add('prediction','Scoring RET-P04 (messy CSV) in part for the CRM path: (b) Indian 10-digit numbers without +91 are misparsed (to +1) rather than rejected; (a) duplicates are not de-duplicated across number formats. The batch-call path and the CSV import were not exercised (batch is billable; import needs a dashboard JWT), so (c) to (e) remain untested.','observed',[D+'api-writes/create-contact-plain10.json',D+'api-writes/create-contact-e164-twin.json'])
